{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1059853/block/singleImage/3246132/df/01M5J1E99REBGBNAZKM8QGP72Q.jpg?updatedAt=1792680964\"/><figcaption>ViuTV劇集《地獄大狀》自播出以來，獲得不少好評。</figcaption></figure><p>ViuTV劇集《地獄大狀》日前播出的一集有林愷鈴(Ashley)與魏浚笙(Jeffrey)接吻的場口，正當不少女網民幻想自己是Ashley之際，沒料到有網民批評Jeffrey不檢點︰「其實有女朋友係咪要檢點啲呢？做戲還做戲，Jeffery個親熱戲真心覺得Over 咗......使唔使錫到咁狼死？講緊前個禮拜先曬緊周年恩愛.....真心為佢女朋友覺得慘......係咪得我一個覺得唔妥？」 不少網民笑留言者是清朝人，並指Jeffrey女友是經理人，怎會不知道男友要拍這些場口，而Jeffrey本人都有親自回應，他表示：「事實係女朋友仲係現場俾曬reference 叫我放膽去做先對得住個角色，其實有咩問題呢？」</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1059853/block/singleImage/3246136/df/01M5J1BNGF9PBHT1AER151RY2W.jpg?updatedAt=1792680964\"/><figcaption>地獄大狀｜魏浚笙咀李林愷玲被人鬧唔檢點。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1059853/block/singleImage/3246137/df/01M5J1HQA6899P495CBKKT04HC.jpeg?updatedAt=1792680964\"/><figcaption>Jeffrey親自回覆。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.306815+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":366,"images":3,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:56:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T19:50:58.841892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:15.333906+00:00","content_hash":"4a6a8f7111c94b7290cc8552b588cad4db019b440ec59a77ff9e15f7b5d8d577","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.306815+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}